Full legal text: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode


-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SCOPE OF THIS DEDICATION
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The CC0 dedication above covers everything authored in this repository:

  * all source code (src/*.js, index.html, style.css)
  * all geometry, which is generated procedurally at runtime
  * all textures, which are generated procedurally at runtime from code in
    src/textures.js — no scanned, photographed, or downloaded image is used,
    so there is no third-party image licence to inherit.

There are no bundled binary assets. Nothing here is derived from a
copyrighted texture pack, model library, or photo source.


-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
THIRD-PARTY DEPENDENCIES (not covered by this dedication)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

three.js
  Loaded from a CDN at runtime; not vendored in this repository.
  Copyright (c) 2010-2025 three.js authors — MIT Licence.
  https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js/blob/dev/LICENSE

Demo video content
  The default playlist in src/videoscreen.js streams Blender Foundation open
  movies (Big Buck Bunny, Sintel, Tears of Steel, Elephants Dream, Spring,
  Coffee Run, HERO, Caminandes, Glass Half, The Daily Dweebs) from Wikimedia
  Commons. Those films are licensed Creative Commons Attribution (CC-BY) by
  the Blender Foundation — https://www.blender.org

  They are referenced by URL only; no video file is redistributed here. If
  you ship this asset, either keep the on-screen attribution or replace the
  playlist with your own sources. Nothing about the CC-BY films restricts the
  CC0 status of the code and procedural assets in this repository.
